{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    "高级参数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Advanced Parameters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "稳定性": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stability"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相似度": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Similarity"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ElevenLabs 稳定性和相似度须在 0–1 之间。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ElevenLabs stability and similarity must be between 0 and 1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
  "开通官方来电推送": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Enable official incoming-call push service"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "已有推送配置不完整，请先补齐或移除原配置，再重试部署；原配置未被覆盖。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "The existing push configuration is incomplete. Complete or remove it before retrying deployment. It has not been overwritten."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "官方推送服务未确认开通。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "The official push service has not confirmed registration."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "官方来电推送尚未开通。云端配置已保留，请稍后重试部署，会继续完成开通。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "The official incoming-call push service is not ready. Your cloud configuration is saved. Retry deployment shortly to finish setup."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "部署会同时接入官方来电推送服务，向其提供项目标识和专用推送凭据，不发送聊天或录音。后台来电仍需由你在设置中开启。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Deployment also connects the official incoming-call push service using your project ID and a dedicated push credential. No conversations or recordings are sent. You still choose whether to enable background calls in Settings."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "同意并继续": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Agree and continue"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "已阅读": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "I have read the "
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "，同意上述数据发送。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": " and agree to the data sharing described above."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "同意上述数据发送": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Allow the data sharing described above"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "已勾选": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Checked"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "未勾选": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Unchecked"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "发送的数据": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Data sent"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "接收方与数据用途": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Recipients and data use"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "确认下列服务后，可在底部统一授权。之后仍可在各连接设置中单独关闭。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Review the services below, then allow them together at the bottom. You can turn off each service separately in its connection settings later."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "地址未配置完整，本次不会授权；完善连接后可单独确认。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "The address is incomplete, so this connection will not be authorized. Complete its settings to review it separately."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "暂不授权": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Not now"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "请确认已配置服务的接收方和数据用途，并开启你要使用的服务。未允许的连接无法用于通话或同步；之后可在连接设置中修改。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Review the recipients and data use for your configured services, then enable the services you want to use. Connections without permission cannot be used for calls or sync. You can change these choices in each connection’s settings."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "确认服务数据发送": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Review service data sharing"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "继续使用已有连接前，请确认授权": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Review permissions before continuing with existing connections"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "来电提示": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Incoming call notice"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "检查连接授权": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Review connection permissions"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "请求发起于": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Request started"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "只输入你自己刚在浏览器里看到的授权码。别人发给你的码不要输入，也不要替别人批准授权。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Only enter a code you just saw in your own browser. Never enter a code someone sent you or approve a connection on their behalf."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "确认同步目标？": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Confirm sync destination?"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "目的地：%@。将读取此服务和当前令牌所属账户的记录；之后会按已开启的同步设置向该目标发送通话文字、图片、摘要及另行允许的录音。请确认这是你信任的服务和账户。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Destination: %@. Records will be read from this service and the account identified by the current token. Afterwards, enabled sync settings will send call text, images, summaries and separately authorized recordings to this destination. Confirm that you trust this service and account."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "接收方": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Recipient"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "允许向此服务发送上述数据": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Allow sending the data described above to this service"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "数据发送授权": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Data sharing permission"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "隐私政策": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Privacy Policy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "数据处理与第三方服务": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Data handling and third-party services"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "尚未填写服务地址": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "No service address entered"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "请先打开此连接的设置，确认接收方并允许数据发送：%@": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Open this connection’s settings to review the recipient and allow data sharing: %@"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "请先确认接收方并允许数据发送。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Review the recipient and allow data sharing first."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "允许部署并向所选项目发送数据": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Allow deployment and data sharing with the selected project"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "此来电所需连接尚未授权，请打开 App 确认数据发送授权。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "A service required for this call has not been authorized. Open the app to review data-sharing permission."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "关闭授权后，仍可向原服务发送设备解绑请求，以停用后台来电。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "After revoking permission, you can still send a device-unbinding request to the original service to disable background calls."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "迁移：MCP 通话与授权保护": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Migration: MCP call and authorization safeguards"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "迁移：授权注册与推送清理": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Migration: authorization registration and push cleanup"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "此模型服务会接收你启用的角色设定、称呼、历史上下文、当前文字及主动发送的图片或原声音频，用于对话和摘要。内容可能包含个人信息，由该服务按其隐私政策处理。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "This model service receives your enabled persona, preferred name, conversation context, current text, and images or original audio you choose to send, for conversations and summaries. This may include personal data, handled under the service’s privacy policy."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "此语音服务会接收待朗读的回复文字、声音 ID 和合成参数，文字可能包含个人信息，由该服务按其隐私政策处理。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "This speech service receives reply text to read aloud, the voice ID and synthesis settings. Text may include personal data, handled under the service’s privacy policy."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "此识别服务会接收麦克风录到的语音并返回文字，语音可能包含个人信息，由该服务按其隐私政策处理。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "This recognition service receives microphone audio and returns text. Audio may include personal data, handled under the service’s privacy policy."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "此连接端及其接入的 AI 平台会按所用功能接收联系人设定、称呼、通话文字和图片。开启同步后还会接收记录、摘要及另行允许的录音；后台来电会传输设备标识与必要路由信息。请只连接你信任的服务，并了解其数据处理方式。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "This connector and its connected AI platforms receive contact settings, your preferred name, call text and images as needed for the features you use. Enabling sync also shares records, summaries and separately authorized recordings; background calls send device identifiers and necessary routing metadata. Only connect services you trust and understand how they handle data."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Supabase 会接收项目部署配置及必要的账户标识。部署的 Tincall 服务按所启用功能接收通话输入、联系人设定、图片与路由信息；记录和录音同步需另外开启。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Supabase receives project deployment settings and necessary account identifiers. The deployed Tincall service receives call input, contact settings, images and routing metadata according to enabled features. Record and recording sync must be enabled separately."
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "远端设备绑定未能自动清除，可在服务端另行移除。本机连接的删除不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The remote device binding could not be removed automatically. You can remove it on the server separately. This does not affect deletion of the local connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "" : {

    },
    "\n%@：\n%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\n%@:\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n思考：\n%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\nReasoning:\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n服务端错误：\n%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\nServer Error:\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "-1 为动态预算，0 为关闭" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "-1 for dynamic, 0 for off"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "—" : {

    },
    "..." : {

    },
    "·" : {

    },
    "· 正在听" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "· Listening"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· 正在回复" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "· Replying"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· 正在生成" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "· Replying"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· 正在等待回复" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "· Waiting for a reply"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云端同步状态未能读取，请重新打开 App 后再删除连接。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloud sync status could not be loaded. Reopen the app before deleting the connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云端同步状态未能读取，请重新打开 App 后再清理，以保护云端副本。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloud sync status could not be loaded. Reopen the app before cleaning up to protect cloud copies."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保留通话文字、摘要和图片" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep transcripts, summaries, and images"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保留通话文字、摘要和录音" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep transcripts, summaries, and recordings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除全部通话记录及其文字、摘要、图片和录音。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete all call records, including their transcripts, summaries, images, and recordings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除已保存的双方录音，保留通话文字、摘要和图片。录音保存开关不变。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete saved recordings of both speakers. Transcripts, summaries, and images are kept. Recording settings stay the same."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除文字、摘要、图片和录音" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete transcripts, summaries, images, and recordings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除消息中的图片，保留通话文字、摘要和录音。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete message images. Transcripts, summaries, and recordings are kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除本机配置、访问凭据和关联选择，保留联系人、通话记录及云端数据。后台会尝试解除该服务的设备绑定；若服务不可达，远端绑定需另行清理。受影响的联系人需重新选择连接才能通话。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete this local connection, credentials, and associated selections. Contacts, call records, and cloud data are kept. Device unregistration is attempted in the background; if the service is unreachable, remove the remote binding separately. Affected contacts need a new connection to make calls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除这套连接配置？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete This Connection?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除连接" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete Connection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所选本机数据已清理。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The selected local data has been cleared."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在同步云端，请完成后再清理本机数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wait for cloud sync to finish before cleaning up local data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此操作无法撤销。联系人、连接配置、云端副本及已导出文件保留；与云端不同的内容将在同步时等待你手动选择。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This cannot be undone. Contacts, connection settings, cloud copies, and exported files are kept. Content that differs from the cloud will require your choice when syncing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每项单独确认，清理后无法撤销。联系人、连接配置、云端副本及已导出文件保留。若清理后的内容与云端不同，后续同步需手动选择保留哪一份。通话、导入或云端同步期间不可清理。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each category requires confirmation and cannot be undone. Contacts, connection settings, cloud copies, and exported files are kept. If local content differs from the cloud after cleanup, you will need to choose which copy to keep when syncing. Cleanup is unavailable during calls, imports, or cloud sync."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "清理" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clear"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "清理全部通话记录" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clear All Call Records"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "清理所有录音" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clear All Recordings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "清理所有消息图片" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clear All Message Images"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "清理未全部完成：%@ 已完成的部分不会撤销。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cleanup was not completed: %@ Completed changes will not be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
