    "00:00" : {

    },
    "1  编辑联系人，通话方式选 MCP，选已连接且支持 MCP 的服务后保存。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1  Edit a contact, choose MCP, select a connected service that supports MCP, and save."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 · 准备项目" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 · Prepare the Project"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 · 打开或创建 Supabase 项目" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 · Open or Create a Supabase Project"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 · 打开或创建项目" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 · Open or Create a Project"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. 先到「Tincall 云端」检查服务连接，再到「后台与定时来电」开启「允许后台来电」，确认设备已绑定；绑定失败时查看提示并重试。\n\n2. 后台或锁屏来电还需要支持推送的 App 签名，以及与该签名匹配的推送服务。App Store 版的来电通知发送端由作者维护，用户无需自行配置 Apple 推送凭据，也不另收推送费用；自行签名或自部署的版本需要自己准备匹配的签名和推送服务。免费 Apple ID 自行签名不具备这项能力；仅部署云端不能补上签名能力。\n\n3. 定时计划需已启用，并核对联系人、日期、时间和时区。App 内的计划仅用于独立模式联系人，MCP／后端的来电时间由外部平台安排。\n\n4. 确认手机和服务在线，并检查系统音量、静音与专注模式是否影响提醒。普通 MCP 还需要外部 AI 正在运行；使用唤醒桥时，接入程序也需保持运行。\n\n不开启后台来电，也可在 App 前台接听已配置联系人的来电；连接检查成功不代表推送绑定已经完成。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Check the service connection in Tincall Cloud. In Background & Scheduled Calls, enable background calls and confirm the device is bound. If binding fails, check the message and retry.\n\n2. Background and Lock Screen calls require an app signed with push capability and a matching push service. The App Store version uses a push sender maintained by the author, so users do not need to configure Apple push credentials or pay a separate push fee. Self-signed or self-deployed versions need their own matching signature and push service. Signing with a free Apple ID does not provide this capability; deploying a cloud service alone cannot add it.\n\n3. Make sure the schedule is enabled and check the contact, date, time, and time zone. In-app schedules are for Standalone contacts only. MCP and backend calls are scheduled by the external platform.\n\n4. Keep the phone and service online, and check whether system volume, Silent mode, or Focus affects alerts. Standard MCP also needs the external AI to be running. A wake bridge needs its adapter to stay running.\n\nConfigured contacts can still call while the app is in the foreground without background calls enabled. A successful connection check does not confirm push binding."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. 先确定通话方式：要通过支持 MCP 的平台与 AI 通话，选 MCP；已有适配 Tincall 的对话后端，选后端；想在 Tincall 内配置模型和人物设定，选独立模式。\n\n2. 准备对话来源：独立模式在「API设置」添加并测试聊天模型；后端或 MCP 先在「Tincall 云端 → 连接云端」部署或连接相应服务，保存连接配置。\n\n3. 配置声音与识别：在「文字转语音」添加并测试声音预设；在「我的设置 → 语音识别」选择识别服务，按所选服务填写凭据并运行测试。\n\n4. 新建或编辑联系人，选择通话方式和声音预设。独立模式再选聊天模型、填写人物设定；后端选择连接与对话对象；MCP 选择连接后保存，再把该联系人的完整 MCP 配置复制到对应 AI 平台，并按本页接入指令让 AI 开始等待通话输入。\n\n打开通话页后，按提示补齐缺项，并在首次收音时允许使用麦克风。复制 MCP 配置后，仍需让 AI 在平台中开始等待通话输入。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Choose where replies will come from: select MCP for an AI on a platform that supports MCP; Backend for an existing conversation service adapted for Tincall; or Standalone to configure a model and persona in Tincall.\n\n2. Prepare that source: for Standalone, add and test a chat model in API Settings. For Backend or MCP, deploy or connect the appropriate service in Tincall Cloud → Connect to Cloud and save the connection.\n\n3. Set up speech: add and test a voice preset in Text to Speech. Select a service in My Settings → Speech Recognition, enter any required credentials, and run its test.\n\n4. Create or edit a contact and select the call mode and voice preset. For Standalone, also select a chat model and enter a persona. For Backend, select the connection and conversation partner. For MCP, select the connection and save, then copy that contact’s full MCP configuration to the matching AI platform and start the AI using the integration instructions on this page.\n\nOpen the call screen, complete any missing items, and allow microphone access when first using voice input. Copying an MCP configuration does not mean the AI on the platform is already waiting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. 先确定通话方式：要通过支持 MCP 的平台与 AI 通话，选 MCP；已有适配 Tincall 的对话后端，选后端；想在 Tincall 内配置模型和人物设定，选独立模式。\n\n2. 准备对话来源：独立模式在「API设置」添加并测试聊天模型；后端或 MCP 先在「Tincall 云端」部署或连接相应服务，保存连接配置。\n\n3. 配置声音与识别：在「文字转语音」添加并测试声音预设；在「我的设置 → 语音识别」选择识别服务，按所选服务填写凭据并运行测试。\n\n4. 新建或编辑联系人，选择通话方式和声音预设。独立模式再选聊天模型、填写人物设定；后端选择连接与对话对象；MCP 选择连接后保存，再把该联系人的完整 MCP 配置复制到对应 AI 平台，并按本页接入指令让 AI 开始等待通话输入。\n\n打开通话页后，按提示补齐缺项，并在首次收音时允许使用麦克风。复制 MCP 配置后，仍需让 AI 在平台中开始等待通话输入。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Choose where replies will come from: select MCP for an AI on a platform that supports MCP; Backend for an existing conversation service adapted for Tincall; or Standalone to configure a model and persona in Tincall.\n\n2. Prepare that source: for Standalone, add and test a chat model in API Settings. For Backend or MCP, deploy or connect the appropriate service in Tincall Cloud and save the connection.\n\n3. Set up speech: add and test a voice preset in Text to Speech. Select a service in My Settings → Speech Recognition, enter any required credentials, and run its test.\n\n4. Create or edit a contact and select the call mode and voice preset. For Standalone, also select a chat model and enter a persona. For Backend, select the connection and conversation partner. For MCP, select the connection and save, then copy that contact’s full MCP configuration to the matching AI platform and start the AI using the integration instructions on this page.\n\nOpen the call screen, complete any missing items, and allow microphone access when first using voice input. Copying an MCP configuration does not mean the AI on the platform is already waiting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
