    "1. 检查 iPhone 音量，并在系统控制中心确认音频输出设备，确认声音没有播放到其他耳机或设备。\n\n2. 到「文字转语音」测试联系人正在使用的声音预设，核对 API Key、声音 ID、合成模型、服务地区和账户额度。\n\n3. 查看通话页的合成错误及「请求日志」中的语音合成请求。\n\n文字生成和声音合成是两项服务；模型回复成功不代表声音已合成。合成失败时，已收到的文字仍会保留。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Check the iPhone volume and confirm the audio output device in Control Center. Make sure sound is not playing through another headset or device.\n\n2. Test the contact’s voice preset in Text to Speech. Check the API key, voice ID, synthesis model, service region, and account quota.\n\n3. Check synthesis errors on the call screen and speech synthesis requests in Request Logs.\n\nText generation and speech synthesis are separate services. A successful model reply does not mean audio was synthesized. Received text remains available if synthesis fails."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. 检查 iPhone 音量和通话内设置的声音输出，确认声音没有播放到其他耳机或设备。\n2. 到「文字转语音」测试联系人正在使用的声音预设，核对 API Key、声音 ID、合成模型、服务地区和账户额度。\n3. 查看通话页的合成错误及「请求日志」中的语音合成请求。\n文字生成和声音合成是两项服务；模型回复成功不代表声音已合成。合成失败时，已收到的文字仍会保留。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Check your iPhone volume and audio output in Call Settings. Make sure audio is not playing through another headset or device.\n2. Test the contact’s voice preset in Text to Speech. Check its API Key, voice ID, speech model, region, and account quota.\n3. Check the synthesis error on the call screen and the speech synthesis request in Request Logs.\nText generation and speech synthesis are separate services. A successful model reply does not mean audio was synthesized. Received text is kept if synthesis fails."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. 检查通话页是否关麦、是否正在编辑文字；退出输入后再试。\n\n2. 在 iPhone「设置 → App → Tincall」检查麦克风权限。\n\n3. 回「我的设置 → 语音识别」运行识别测试。Apple 识别需要设备、语言与系统模型可用；讯飞、百炼等服务需要有效凭据、网络和服务额度。\n\n4. 使用 Whisper 兼容服务时，文字会在一段话结束并上传后返回，不会逐字出现。\n\n仍失败时，查看通话页错误提示和「请求日志」中的语音识别请求。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Check whether the microphone is muted or text input is open. Close text input and try again.\n\n2. Check microphone access in iPhone Settings → Apps → Tincall.\n\n3. Run a recognition test in My Settings → Speech Recognition. Apple recognition needs a supported device, language, and system model. Services such as Xunfei and Bailian need valid credentials, a network connection, and available quota.\n\n4. Whisper-compatible services return text after a speech segment is uploaded, rather than word by word.\n\nIf it still fails, check the call screen error and the recognition request in Request Logs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. 检查通话页是否关麦、是否正在编辑文字；退出输入后再试。\n2. 在 iPhone「设置 → App → Tincall」检查麦克风权限。\n3. 回「我的设置 → 语音识别」运行识别测试。Apple 识别需要设备、语言与系统模型可用；讯飞、百炼等服务需要有效凭据、网络和服务额度。\n4. 使用 Whisper 兼容服务时，文字会在一段话结束并上传后返回，不会逐字出现。\n仍失败时，查看通话页错误提示和「请求日志」中的语音识别请求。" : {
