            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incoming calls from AI: supported. AI on an external platform can call you using MCP tools.\n\nCalling from Tincall: MCP alone cannot wake the AI. Start the AI on the external platform first and have it use the tools to wait for call input. To wake the AI automatically when you call, you must also connect a wake bridge.\n\nChoose Get Wake Bridge Configuration in a saved service, then connect it to a platform that supports event subscriptions and AI task creation, or run your own adapter. Copying the MCP URL alone does not enable the wake bridge."
