    "使用独立模式，可按以下顺序完成：\n1. 在「API设置」添加聊天模型，填写服务地址、API Key 和模型名称，并测试连接。\n2. 在「文字转语音」添加声音预设，填写所选服务的凭据、合成模型和声音 ID。\n3. 在「我的设置 → 语音识别」选择识别服务；使用第三方服务时填写对应凭据，可先运行识别测试。\n4. 新建或编辑联系人，通话方式选「独立模式」，选择聊天模型与声音预设，保存后打开通话页。\n首次通话时允许使用麦克风。没有配置完整时，通话页会列出缺少的项目；点击「完成通话配置」返回补齐。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For Independent Mode, follow these steps:\n1. Add a chat model in API Settings. Enter the service URL, API Key, and model name, then test the connection.\n2. Add a voice preset in Text to Speech. Enter your provider credentials, speech model, and voice ID.\n3. Choose a recognition service in My Settings → Speech Recognition. Enter credentials for third-party services. You can run a recognition test first.\n4. Create or edit a contact, choose Independent Mode, select the chat model and voice preset, then save and open the call screen.\nAllow microphone access for your first call. If setup is incomplete, the call screen lists what is missing. Tap Finish Call Setup to add it."
          }
        }
