    },
    "先区分声音本身卡顿，还是句子之间等待：\n\n1. 在「文字转语音」测试当前声音预设。测试也卡顿时，检查网络、服务额度与合成错误。\n\n2. 测试顺畅、通话中停顿较长时，查看回复文字是否仍在生成，以及后续语音合成是否还在等待。分段朗读需要等待下一段文字和音频到达。\n\n3. 临时切换到 iPhone 扬声器，确认是否只在某副蓝牙耳机上发生。\n\n4. 如果声音总在你说话或环境有声音时停下，检查是否启用了「允许说话打断」，并查看转写结果。\n\n反馈时请说明是整段卡顿、句间停顿，还是突然停止，以及当时的输出设备。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "First distinguish choppy audio from waiting between sentences:\n\n1. Test the current voice preset in Text to Speech. If the test also stutters, check the network, service quota, and synthesis errors.\n\n2. If the test is smooth but calls have long pauses, check whether reply text is still being generated or later audio is still being synthesized. Segmented playback must wait for the next text and audio segment.\n\n3. Temporarily switch to the iPhone speaker to check whether the issue only occurs with a particular Bluetooth headset.\n\n4. If playback stops when you speak or there is background noise, check Allow Voice Interruption and review the transcript.\n\nIn feedback, describe whether audio stutters, pauses between sentences, or stops entirely, and name the output device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先去网页准备项目，再回来填好资料并部署。" : {
