        }
      }
    },
    "先在设置添加聊天模型与文字转语音预设，再点顶部的「我的设置」选择语音识别服务。为联系人选择聊天模型与声音后，打开通话页即可发起。首次使用需要麦克风权限；Apple 识别还可能下载系统语言模型。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add chat model and text-to-speech presets in Settings, then open My Settings at the top to choose a speech recognition service. Choose a chat model and voice for your contact, then open the call screen to call. Microphone access is required on first use; Apple recognition may also download a system language model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先恢复网络或外部服务，再点通话页的「恢复连接」。App 关闭后，可以从未结束的通话记录恢复。恢复会补取未收到的事件，不会重新播放已有声音。\n\n如果远端已经结束电话，需要重新拨号，不能把已结束的电话恢复成新通话。若错误持续，请检查服务地址、手机访问令牌与服务运行状态，不要反复新建连接覆盖原配置。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Restore the network or external service, then tap Reconnect on the call screen. After reopening the app, you can resume an unfinished call from its record. Resuming fetches missed events without replaying existing audio.\n\nIf the remote call has ended, dial again. An ended call cannot be resumed as a new one. If errors persist, check the service URL, phone access token, and service status. Do not repeatedly create replacement connections."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先恢复网络或外部服务，再点通话页的「恢复连接」。App 关闭后，可以从未结束的通话记录恢复。恢复会补取未收到的事件，不会重新播放已有声音。\n如果远端已经结束电话，需要重新拨号，不能把已结束的电话恢复成新通话。若错误持续，请检查服务地址、手机访问令牌与服务运行状态，不要反复新建连接覆盖原配置。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Restore the network or external service, then tap Reconnect on the call screen. After reopening the app, you can resume an unfinished call from its record. Resuming fetches missed events without replaying existing audio.\nIf the remote call has ended, dial again. An ended call cannot be resumed as a new one. If errors persist, check the service URL, phone access token, and service status. Do not repeatedly create replacement connections."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先恢复网络或外部服务，再点通话页的「恢复通话连接」。App 重开后，原始且尚未结束的后端／MCP 通话可从记录恢复，前提是原联系人及连接配置仍然有效。恢复会补取未收到的事件，不会重新播放已有声音。\n\n独立模式记录、备份导入的记录及远端已结束的通话不能这样恢复，需要重新拨号。若错误持续，请检查服务地址、手机访问令牌与服务运行状态。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Restore the network or external service, then tap Restore Call Connection on the call screen. After reopening the app, an original, unfinished Backend or MCP call can be resumed from its record if the original contact and connection settings are still valid. Resuming retrieves missed events without replaying existing audio.\n\nStandalone records, records imported from backups, and calls already ended remotely cannot be resumed this way; start a new call. If errors continue, check the service URL, phone access token, and service status."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先查看导出内容，再决定分享范围。请求日志可能包含发送给模型的上下文、识别文字、回复、思考内容及错误信息，即使凭据被打码，也可能暴露对话隐私。\n\n建议先按服务类型和失败状态筛选，只分享与问题有关的请求，删除其中的个人信息。不要分享 API Key、手机访问令牌、联系人 MCP 令牌、录音或完整私人备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Review the export before deciding what to share. Request logs may contain model context, recognized speech, replies, reasoning, and errors. They can expose private conversations even when credentials are redacted.\n\nFilter by service and failure status first. Share only relevant requests and remove personal information. Do not share API keys, phone access tokens, contact MCP tokens, recordings, or full private backups."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先查看导出内容，再决定分享范围。请求日志可能包含发送给模型的上下文、识别文字、回复、思考内容及错误信息，即使凭据被打码，也可能暴露对话隐私。\n建议先按服务类型和失败状态筛选，只分享与问题有关的请求，删除其中的个人信息。不要分享 API Key、手机访问令牌、联系人 MCP 令牌、录音或完整私人备份。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Review the export before deciding what to share. Request logs may contain model context, recognized speech, replies, reasoning, and errors. They can expose private conversations even when credentials are redacted.\nFilter by service and failure status first. Share only relevant requests and remove personal information. Do not share API keys, phone access tokens, contact MCP tokens, recordings, or full private backups."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先用独立模式完成一次通话：\n\n1. 到「API设置」添加聊天模型，填写服务地址、API Key 和模型名称，运行测试。\n\n2. 到「文字转语音」添加声音预设，填写服务凭据、声音 ID 和合成模型，测试能否播放。\n\n3. 到「我的设置 → 语音识别」选择识别服务，完成配置并运行识别测试。Apple 本机识别需等待对应语言模型就绪。\n\n4. 添加联系人，通话方式选「独立模式」，选择刚才的聊天模型和声音，在「对话设定」填写人物与对话要求。\n\n5. 保存联系人并拨号，按系统提示允许麦克风权限，说一句话，确认能看到文字并听到回复。\n\n以上步骤无需部署云端。若要使用 MCP 或自己的后端，先看下方的模式说明，再使用「Agent辅助接入」指令。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start with a call in Standalone mode:\n\n1. Add a chat model in API Settings. Enter its endpoint, API key, and model name, then run a test.\n\n2. Add a voice preset in Text to Speech. Enter the service credentials, voice ID, and synthesis model, then test playback.\n\n3. In My Settings → Speech Recognition, choose and configure a service, then test recognition. For Apple on-device recognition, wait until the language model is ready.\n\n4. Add a contact, choose Standalone mode, and select your chat model and voice. Enter the character and conversation instructions in Conversation Setup.\n\n5. Save the contact and call. Allow microphone access when prompted, then say something and check that text appears and a reply plays.\n\nThese steps do not require a cloud deployment. For MCP or your own backend, read the mode guide below, then use the Agent setup instructions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先看慢在什么地方：\n\n说完很久才出现文字：到「我的设置」测试识别服务，检查网络、识别语言和当前输入方式。Whisper 兼容服务会在一段话结束并上传后返回结果。\n\n文字已出现，但对方迟迟没有回复：检查聊天模型或外部平台的请求状态；模型推理、长上下文和平台排队都可能增加等待。普通 MCP 还需确认 AI 正在等新输入。\n\n回复文字已出现，但声音晚到：测试同一声音预设，并查看语音合成请求的耗时或错误。\n\n可在「请求日志」按服务类型查看对应请求，先确认慢在哪一段，再调整该项配置。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "First identify where the delay occurs:\n\nText takes a long time to appear after you speak: test recognition in My Settings and check the network, language, and current input mode. Whisper-compatible services return results after an utterance ends and is uploaded.\n\nYour text appears, but the reply is delayed: check the chat model or external platform request. Model reasoning, long context, and platform queues can add delay. For standard MCP, also check that the AI is waiting for input.\n\nReply text appears, but audio starts late: test the same voice preset and check synthesis request timing or errors.\n\nFilter Request Logs by service type to locate the slow stage before changing its settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
