      }
    },
    "到「我的设置 → 语音识别」用同一句话做识别测试，检查识别语言是否正确，并尽量避开背景音乐、回声与多人同时说话。也可对比已配置的其他识别服务。\n\n名字或专有词反复出错时，可在「高频错词修正」添加原词与替换词；规则尽量具体，避免把正常句子也替换掉。\n\n通话内使用「原声输入」时，字幕由 Apple 本机识别产生，模型收到的是本轮录音；字幕不准不一定表示模型听到的内容也相同。紧急补充或纠正时，可切到文字视图直接发送。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Test the same sentence in My Settings → Speech Recognition. Check the recognition language and reduce background music, echo, and overlapping speech. You can also compare other configured recognition services.\n\nFor recurring mistakes in names or special terms, add an original word and replacement in Frequent Word Corrections. Keep rules specific to avoid replacing correct text.\n\nWith Original Audio Input enabled during a call, Apple on-device recognition generates captions while the model receives the current recording. Incorrect captions do not necessarily reflect what the model heard. Switch to text view to send a correction when needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
