    },
    "在 API 预设里设置。模型默认不发送思考字段；OpenAI 兼容服务按支持程度选择强度，Anthropic 分自适应强度与手动预算，Gemini 按模型选择强度或预算。提高强度通常会增加等待与用量。Anthropic 最大输出留空时使用 4096；手动思考预算须小于输出上限。摘要同样使用所选 API 预设的输出上限。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set it in an API preset. Model Default omits thinking fields. OpenAI-compatible services offer supported effort levels; Anthropic offers adaptive effort or a manual budget; Gemini uses effort or budget depending on the model. Higher effort usually increases wait time and usage. Anthropic uses 4096 when max output is blank. Its manual thinking budget must be below the output limit. Summaries also use the output limit of their selected API preset."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 ChatGPT 添加 MCP 服务时选择 OAuth，将授权页显示的一次性授权码填在这里。" : {

