    },
    "在通话内设置中确认已开启「允许说话打断」，麦克风没有关闭，也没有停留在文字输入状态。\n\n说话打断需检测到持续人声并识别出文字。很短的声音、识别失败或识别服务延迟，可能不会立即触发；可先做识别测试。它不识别说话人的身份，背景人声也可能触发。\n\n需要立刻停止时，使用手动打断；发送新的文字或图片也会中断当前回复并开始下一轮。普通 MCP 能否取消外部 AI 的生成，还受所用平台限制。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In call settings, enable Allow Voice Interruption. Make sure the microphone is on and you are not editing text.\n\nVoice interruption requires sustained speech and recognized text. Very short sounds, recognition failures, or recognition delays may not trigger it immediately; test speech recognition first. It does not identify the speaker, so background speech may also trigger it.\n\nUse manual interruption to stop immediately. Sending new text or an image also interrupts the reply and starts a new turn. Whether standard MCP can cancel the external AI generation depends on the platform."
          }
        }
      }
    },
