    "对话设定填写后自动使用，留空则不携带。摘要关闭或携带条数为 0 时不带入历史摘要。当前通话按时间顺序放在最后。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conversation instructions are included when filled in and omitted when blank. Past summaries are omitted when summaries are disabled or the count is 0. The current call follows in chronological order."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入：选择完整备份文件夹，合并到本机。同一通话只导入一次，已有记录保留本机版本。备份大小和记录数量不设固定上限，请确保本机有足够的剩余空间。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Import: Select the complete backup folder to merge it onto this device. Each call is imported only once, keeping the local version of existing records. There are no fixed limits on backup size or record count. Make sure this device has enough free storage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入：选择完整备份文件夹，合并到本机。同一通话只导入一次，已有记录保留本机版本。配置和文字清单合计最多 64 MB，单通话清单最多 8 MB；消息图片与录音合计最多 2 GB、50,000 个文件。超限会提示失败，不会省略内容。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Import: select the complete backup folder to merge it into this device. Each call is imported only once; existing calls keep the local version. Configuration and text manifests are limited to 64 MB in total, with an 8 MB limit per call manifest. Message images and audio are limited to 2 GB and 50,000 files in total. Exceeding a limit reports a failure without silently omitting content."
          }
        }
      }
    },
