    "将从 Tincall 移除「%@」。正在使用时会恢复系统默认，原字体文件不受影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remove “%@” from Tincall? If it is in use, the system font will be restored. The original font file will be kept."
          }
