      }
    },
    "左右滑动通话内容，或在通话内设置中切换「通话／文字」视图。文字视图可以查看完整对话、输入文字，并通过输入框左侧「＋」添加图片；图片能否被理解，取决于所选模型或外部服务是否支持。\n\n输入文字时临时暂停收音，退出输入后恢复；手动关麦状态保持不变。打字本身不会打断回复，发送新内容会中断当前回复并开始下一轮。点击已添加或已发送的图片可放大查看。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Swipe left or right on call content, or switch between Call and Text in Call Settings. Text View shows the full conversation and lets you type or add images with + next to the message field. Image understanding depends on your model or external service.\n\nTyping temporarily pauses microphone input; closing text input restores it. A manually muted microphone stays muted. Typing alone does not interrupt a reply. Sending new content interrupts the current reply and starts another turn. Tap an attached or sent image to enlarge it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "左右滑动通话内容，或在通话内设置中切换「通话／文字」视图。文字视图可以查看完整对话、输入文字，并通过输入框左侧「＋」添加图片；图片能否被理解，取决于所选模型或外部服务是否支持。\n输入文字时临时暂停收音，退出输入后恢复；手动关麦状态保持不变。打字本身不会打断回复，发送新内容会中断当前回复并开始下一轮。点击已添加或已发送的图片可放大查看。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Swipe left or right on call content, or switch between Call and Text in Call Settings. Text View shows the full conversation and lets you type or add images with + next to the message field. Image understanding depends on your model or external service.\nTyping temporarily pauses microphone input; closing text input restores it. A manually muted microphone stays muted. Typing alone does not interrupt a reply. Sending new content interrupts the current reply and starts another turn. Tap an attached or sent image to enlarge it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
