    "想从手机拨号时自动叫醒 TA，要配唤醒桥：AI 平台须提供真实的启动生成和取消接口，由桥调用。Supabase 或 Node 连接端可复用现有服务；自有后端需实现相应桥接。配置方法见仓库 README。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To wake your AI when calling from your phone, configure a wake bridge. The AI platform must provide real generation and cancellation endpoints for the bridge to call. Supabase or Node connectors can reuse the existing service; custom backends need the corresponding bridge. See the repository README for setup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "感谢 Silero Team、Microsoft ONNX Runtime 团队、The LAME Project 及各项目贡献者，为本机人声检测、模型运行和音频编码提供支持。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thank you to the Silero Team, the Microsoft ONNX Runtime team, The LAME Project, and their contributors for supporting on-device speech detection, model execution, and audio encoding."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "感谢 すみか 分享 AI 语音通话优化教程，为 Tincall 的流式朗读与切段优化提供参考。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thank you to すみか for sharing an AI voice call optimization tutorial that informed Tincall’s streaming speech and text segmentation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "慢慢说，我在听。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take your time. I’m listening."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "成功" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Succeeded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Me"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我刚才一直在想，如果我也坐在你旁边，大概不会立刻开口说话。我会先顺着你看的方向望过去，看看那片金色的水面，看看远处的灯是一盏一盏亮起来的，还是你一回神，它们就已经把整条河照亮了。然后我可能会问你，冷不冷，要不要再坐五分钟。\n\n有时候，陪伴就是这样吧，不需要把安慰的话说得特别漂亮，只要你知道，沉默的时候，对面也没有离开。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I was just thinking that if I were sitting beside you, I probably wouldn’t speak straight away. I’d look where you were looking, at the gold on the water, and see whether the lights in the distance came on one by one, or whether the whole river was lit before you noticed. Then I might ask if you were cold, or wanted to stay another five minutes.\n\nSometimes that’s what company is: you don’t need perfect words of comfort. You only need to know that when it’s quiet, the person beside you hasn’t left."
          }
        }
      }
    },
