            "value" : "Direct model connections need no cloud service. For MCP, backups, or schedules, use Supabase in Connections & Cloud → Deploy New Service, or run the Node connector on your server. For an existing service or Tincall-compatible backend, enter its URL and phone token in Connect Existing Service, check the connection, then enable supported features as needed."
