    "打断" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Interrupt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打断、关麦和挂断有什么区别？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What is the difference between interrupting, muting, and ending a call?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打断：停止当前回复和声音播放，电话保持接通，可以继续说话或输入。\n\n关麦：停止接收你接下来的语音，不结束电话，也不取消对方正在进行的回复。\n\n挂断：停止当前生成和播放，结束电话。已收到的文字仍保留，中断的回复会注明原因。\n\n「允许说话打断」在通话内设置中开启；它需要检测到持续人声并识别出文字，不是任意声音都会触发。未开启时仍可使用手动打断。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Interrupt: Stops the current reply and speech playback while keeping the call connected. You can keep speaking or typing.\n\nMute: Stops receiving your next speech input. It does not end the call or cancel the current reply.\n\nEnd Call: Stops the current generation and playback, then ends the call. Received text is kept, with a reason added to interrupted replies.\n\nEnable Allow Voice Interruptions in Call Settings. This requires sustained speech and recognized words; arbitrary sounds do not trigger it. Manual interruption remains available when it is off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打断：停止当前回复和声音播放，电话保持接通，可以继续说话或输入。\n关麦：停止接收你接下来的语音，不结束电话，也不取消对方正在进行的回复。\n挂断：停止当前生成和播放，结束电话。已收到的文字仍保留，中断的回复会注明原因。\n「允许说话打断」在通话内设置中开启；它需要检测到持续人声并识别出文字，不是任意声音都会触发。未开启时仍可使用手动打断。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Interrupt: Stops the current reply and speech playback while keeping the call connected. You can keep speaking or typing.\nMute: Stops receiving your next speech input. It does not end the call or cancel the current reply.\nEnd Call: Stops the current generation and playback, then ends the call. Received text is kept, with a reason added to interrupted replies.\nEnable Allow Voice Interruptions in Call Settings. This requires sustained speech and recognized words; arbitrary sounds do not trigger it. Manual interruption remains available when it is off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打断会停止当前回复和播放，保持电话接通。挂断会停止当前生成、播放及整通电话。已收到的文字和选择保留的音频会保存，记录注明中断原因，不猜测某句话听到了哪里。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Interrupt stops the current reply and playback while keeping the call connected. Hang up stops generation, playback, and the entire call. Received text and audio you chose to keep are saved with the interruption reason, without guessing how much of a sentence you heard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
