    "按强度" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "By Effort"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按当前云端版本提交本机文字与摘要。此操作可能替换另一台设备保存的文字，已有云端录音保留；若版本又有变化会再次停止。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Submit local text and summaries against the current cloud version. This may replace text saved by another device; existing cloud recordings remain. If the cloud version changes again, the operation stops."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按本机文件大小统计。配置数据包含联系人、连接设置、头像和通话背景；这里不包含请求日志、导入字体和缓存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sizes are based on local files. Configuration data includes contacts, connection settings, photos, and call backgrounds. Request logs, imported fonts, and caches are not included here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按模型选择自适应思考或指定预算。手动预算至少 1024，且须小于本次输出上限。" : {
