          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接入程序收到通话建立或新消息事件后，自动读取本轮输入，再携带消息启动 AI。AI 通过专用 MCP 回复后结束本轮，下次消息再启动；AI 不需要自己读取或等待下一条消息。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The adapter automatically reads the current input when a call is established or a new message arrives, then starts the AI with that input. The AI replies through the dedicated MCP and ends its task; the next input starts another task. The AI does not need to fetch or wait for new input itself."
          }
