    "文字记录保存在本机。录音默认关闭，可在本地存储里分别选择双方声音。云端同步用于备份通话记录与摘要，录音备份需要单独开启；它不负责聊天平台的生成。关闭录音不会删除已有文件，删除本机记录也不会自动删除已导出的备份或云端副本。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Text records stay on your device. Recording is off by default; choose whose voice to save in Local Storage. Cloud sync backs up call records and summaries. Audio backup must be enabled separately and does not generate chat replies. Turning off recording keeps existing files. Deleting local records does not delete exported backups or cloud copies."
