        }
      }
    },
    "检查系统麦克风授权、通话页是否关麦，以及「设置 → 我的设置 → 语音识别」中选择的服务。Apple 识别需设备与语言受支持、系统模型就绪；讯飞和百炼需要网络和有效账户。Whisper 兼容服务需填写转写地址与模型，说完一段后上传并返回文字，没有逐字字幕。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check microphone access, whether the call is muted, and the service selected in Settings → My Settings → Speech Recognition. Apple recognition requires a supported device and language with system resources ready. Xunfei and Bailian require a network connection and valid accounts. Whisper-compatible services need a transcription URL and model; text returns after each speech segment, without word-by-word captions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查联系人选择的声音预设、Voice ID、合成模型、服务地区与对应凭据。确认设备输出路线和音量。供应商合成失败会在通话页显示，已收到的文字仍会保留。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check the contact's voice preset, Voice ID, speech model, service region, and credentials. Check your device's audio output and volume. Synthesis errors appear on the call screen; text already received is kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
