    "独立" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Independent Mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Independent Mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式、MCP、MCP＋唤醒桥、后端直连怎么选？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How do standalone, MCP, MCP with a wake bridge, and a direct backend differ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式：Tincall 直接连接模型 API，设定与对话由手机管理。日常通话和本地记录无需部署云端。\n\nMCP：外部平台管理 AI，AI 可发起来电并处理 Tincall 发起的通话；从 Tincall 拨出不会自动唤醒外部 AI。AI 回复后默认每次最多等你的下一句话 2 分钟，没有新消息会提示继续等待，不会挂断通话。\n\nMCP＋唤醒桥：仍使用 MCP 通话，但由接通和每轮新输入的事件触发 AI，AI 回复后结束本轮，下次消息再启动，不必持续等待。新版一键部署包含通用桥；在已保存服务的「唤醒桥」按联系人复制配置。平台须支持 SSE 订阅和任务启动，或运行相应适配程序。普通 MCP 设置不能代替这部分接入。\n\n后端直连：已有聊天后端直接实现 Tincall 通话接口，由它管理设定、上下文和每轮生成，无需 MCP。也可通过一键部署的服务转发到真正的生成与取消接口。\n\n联系人页可选独立模式、MCP 或后端；在 MCP 内切换普通 MCP／MCP＋唤醒桥。选择桥接后，可查看专用 MCP 地址和凭据，并复制这位联系人的完整唤醒桥配置。四种方式的识别与朗读均由 Tincall 处理。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standalone: Tincall connects directly to a model API and manages the setup and conversation on the phone. Daily calls and local records do not require cloud deployment.\n\nMCP: An external platform manages the AI. The AI can call you and handle calls from Tincall. Calling from Tincall does not automatically wake the external AI. After replying, the AI waits up to 2 minutes at a time for your next message. With no new input, it is prompted to keep waiting; the call stays connected.\n\nMCP + wake bridge: Call handling still uses MCP. Answering and each new input trigger an AI task; the task ends after replying without keeping a tool waiting. The one-click deployment includes a generic bridge. The platform needs authenticated SSE subscriptions and task launching, or a suitable adapter. Ordinary MCP settings do not replace this integration.\n\nDirect backend: An existing chat backend implements the Tincall call API and manages the setup, context and generation without MCP. The deployed service can forward requests to its actual generation and cancellation endpoints.\n\nThe contact editor offers Standalone, MCP and Backend. Inside MCP, choose Ordinary MCP or MCP + Wake Bridge. The bridge option shows its dedicated MCP URL and credentials and lets you copy this contact’s complete wake configuration. Tincall handles speech recognition and playback for all four approaches."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式：Tincall 直接连接模型 API，设定与对话由手机管理。日常通话和本地记录无需部署云端。\n\n普通 MCP：外部平台管理 AI，AI 可发起来电并处理 Tincall 发起的通话；从 Tincall 拨出不会自动唤醒外部 AI。AI 回复后默认每次最多等你的下一句话 2 分钟，没有新消息会提示继续等待，不会挂断通话。\n\nMCP＋唤醒桥：仍使用 MCP 通话，但由接通和每轮新输入的事件触发 AI，AI 回复后结束本轮，下次消息再启动，不必持续等待。新版一键部署包含通用桥；在联系人编辑页选择该模式并复制配置。平台须支持 SSE 订阅和任务启动，或运行相应适配程序。普通 MCP 设置不能代替这部分接入。\n\n后端直连：已有聊天后端直接实现 Tincall 通话接口，由它管理设定、上下文和每轮生成，无需 MCP。也可通过一键部署的服务转发到真正的生成与取消接口。\n\n四种方式的识别与朗读均由 Tincall 处理。" : {

    },
    "独立模式：到「API设置」测试所选预设，核对模型名称、服务地址、账户额度，以及模型是否支持当前参数或图片输入。\n\n后端或 MCP：先检查已保存的服务连接。普通 MCP 需允许工具调用，并让 AI 等待通话输入；只复制 MCP 配置不会自动启动 AI。使用 MCP＋唤醒桥时，在已保存服务中复制桥接配置，确认平台接入端保持事件订阅并能启动 AI 任务；生成与取消接口属于后端接法，不是唤醒订阅。\n\n在「请求日志」中选择聊天模型或连接请求，查看状态和错误码；连接检查通过不等于模型、备份和来电功能都已可用。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standalone: Test the selected model preset in API Settings and check its model name, URL, quota and supported parameters or image input.\n\nBackend or MCP: Check the saved service connection. With ordinary MCP, allow tools and start the AI waiting for call input; copying MCP settings alone does not start it. With MCP plus a wake bridge, copy the bridge configuration from the saved service and check that the platform adapter keeps its event subscription connected and can start AI tasks. Generation and cancellation endpoints belong to the backend integration, not the wake subscription.\n\nCheck the status and error code of the relevant request in Request Logs. A successful connection check does not prove that every model, backup or incoming-call feature is available."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式：到「API设置」测试所选预设，核对模型名称、服务地址、账户额度，以及模型是否支持当前参数或图片输入。\n\n后端或 MCP：先检查已保存的服务连接。普通 MCP 需允许工具调用，并让 AI 等待通话输入；只复制 MCP 配置不会自动启动 AI。使用 MCP＋唤醒桥时，确认联系人页已复制桥接配置，且 Agent 或接入程序保持事件订阅并能启动 AI 任务；生成与取消接口属于后端接法，不是唤醒订阅。\n\n在「请求日志」中选择聊天模型或连接请求，查看状态和错误码；连接检查通过不等于模型、备份和来电功能都已可用。" : {

    },
    "独立模式：到「API设置」测试所选预设，核对模型名称、服务地址、账户额度，以及模型是否支持当前参数或图片输入。\n后端或 MCP：先检查已保存的服务连接。MCP 平台还需允许工具调用，并让对应 AI 进入等待通话输入的流程；只复制 MCP 配置不会自动启动 AI。需要自动启动时，平台必须提供生成与取消接口，并另行配置唤醒桥。\n在「请求日志」中选择聊天模型或连接请求，查看状态和错误码；连接检查通过不等于模型、备份和来电功能都已可用。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Independent Mode: Test the selected preset in API Settings. Check the model name, service URL, account quota, and support for the current parameters or image input.\nBackend or MCP: Check the saved service connection first. The MCP platform must allow tool calls and start the AI’s process for waiting on call input. Copying MCP settings alone does not start the AI. Automatic startup requires generation and cancellation interfaces from the platform and a separately configured wake bridge.\nSelect the chat model or connection request in Request Logs to inspect its status and error code. A successful connection check does not mean model, backup, and incoming call features are all ready."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式：在 Tincall 中配置聊天模型、人物设定与上下文，由模型 API 生成回复。日常通话和本地记录不需要部署 Tincall 云端。\n\n后端：已有管理 AI 设定和对话的服务，并且实现了 Tincall 接口。先连接该服务，再为联系人选择后端配置。\n\nMCP：在支持 MCP 的 AI 平台中使用 Tincall 工具，让AI 接收输入并回复。先连接支持 MCP 的服务，再按「MCP 接入」为联系人取得配置并复制到 AI 平台。\n\n三种方式都需要配置语音识别和声音预设。独立模式也可能使用联网语音服务，不代表离线通话。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Independent Mode: Configure the chat model, persona, and context in Tincall. The model API generates replies. Everyday calls and local records do not need Tincall Cloud.\n\nBackend: Use an existing service that manages AI settings and conversations and implements the Tincall interface. Connect the service, then choose its backend configuration for a contact.\n\nMCP: Use Tincall tools in an MCP-enabled AI platform so the AI can receive input and reply. Connect an MCP-capable service, then follow MCP Setup to obtain the contact’s configuration and copy it into the AI platform.\n\nAll three modes need speech recognition and a voice preset. Independent Mode can use online voice services; it does not mean offline calls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式：在 Tincall 中配置聊天模型、人物设定与上下文，由模型 API 生成回复。日常通话和本地记录不需要部署 Tincall 云端。\n后端：已有管理 AI 设定和对话的服务，并且实现了 Tincall 接口。先连接该服务，再为联系人选择后端配置。\nMCP：在支持 MCP 的 AI 平台中使用 Tincall 工具，让AI 接收输入并回复。先连接支持 MCP 的服务，再按「MCP 接入」为联系人取得配置并复制到 AI 平台。\n三种方式都需要配置语音识别和声音预设。独立模式也可能使用联网语音服务，不代表离线通话。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Independent Mode: Configure the chat model, persona, and context in Tincall. The model API generates replies. Everyday calls and local records do not need Tincall Cloud.\nBackend: Use an existing service that manages AI settings and conversations and implements the Tincall interface. Connect the service, then choose its backend configuration for a contact.\nMCP: Use Tincall tools in an MCP-enabled AI platform so the AI can receive input and reply. Connect an MCP-capable service, then follow MCP Setup to obtain the contact’s configuration and copy it into the AI platform.\nAll three modes need speech recognition and a voice preset. Independent Mode can use online voice services; it does not mean offline calls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式：希望在 Tincall 内配置模型和人物设定时选择。在「API设置」添加聊天模型，日常通话和本地记录不需要部署 Tincall 云端。\n\n后端：已有管理人物设定和对话的服务，并且实现了 Tincall 接口。先连接该服务，再为联系人选择后端连接与对话对象。\n\nMCP：要通过支持 MCP 的平台与 AI 通话时选择。先连接支持 MCP 的服务，在联系人编辑页选择 MCP、选择连接并保存，再把该联系人的完整配置导入 AI 平台。\n\n后端和 MCP 无需在 Tincall 另配聊天模型 API。三种方式的语音通话都使用 Tincall 中配置的识别服务与声音预设；独立模式也可能使用联网语音服务，不代表离线通话。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standalone: choose this to configure a model and persona in Tincall. Add a chat model in API Settings. Everyday calls and local records do not require Tincall Cloud.\n\nBackend: choose this if you already have a service that manages personas and conversations and implements the Tincall API. Connect it, then select the backend connection and conversation partner for a contact.\n\nMCP: choose this to call an AI on a platform that supports MCP. Connect an MCP-capable service, choose MCP and that connection in the contact editor, save, then import that contact’s complete configuration into the AI platform.\n\nBackend and MCP do not require a separate chat model API in Tincall. All three modes use the recognition service and voice preset configured in Tincall for voice calls. Standalone may still use online speech services; it does not mean offline calling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式使用你配置的模型与语音服务即可通话，不需要在这里部署云端。需要通话备份、MCP 接入或主动来电时，再添加支持 Tincall 协议的服务。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Independent Mode uses your configured model and voice services without a cloud deployment here. Add a Tincall-compatible service when you need call backups, MCP, or incoming calls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式每轮将它作为系统指令发给聊天模型；模型产出的正文和声音标签随后交给 TTS 合成。联系人里的上下文与请求预览可查看实际请求。后端／MCP 的生成由外部平台管理，此本地提示词不会自动传过去，请在声音预设里复制后加入外部平台。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Independent Mode, the chat model receives it as a system instruction each turn. The resulting text and voice tags go to TTS. View the actual request in the contact's context and request preview. Backend and MCP generation is managed externally; this local prompt is not sent automatically. Copy it from the voice preset into your external platform."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式由手机直连模型，使用本机的人物设定与历史摘要，无需部署云端。后端和 MCP 模式先连接已有服务，编辑联系人时选择已保存的配置，外部平台负责生成回复。MCP 的联系人身份、平台接入及可选唤醒桥见「连接与云端 → MCP 接入」。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Independent Mode connects directly from your phone, using the local persona and past summaries without a cloud deployment. For backend or MCP mode, connect a service and select it when editing a contact; the external platform generates replies. See Connections & Cloud → MCP Setup for contact identities, platform setup, and an optional wake bridge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
