    "目的地：%@。录音包含声音和对话隐私，会保存到该项目的私有存储；项目管理者可访问。上传、存储及下载可能产生费用。开启自动同步后，会上传本机已保存的录音，并下载云端已有的录音，不会开启新的录音。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Destination: %@. Audio includes your voice and private conversations. It is saved in the project’s private storage and can be accessed by project administrators. Uploads, storage, and downloads may incur fees. With automatic sync enabled, saved audio uploads from this device and existing cloud audio downloads to it. This does not start recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
