    "第一次设置云端服务，选「部署新服务」，按步骤准备自己的 Supabase 项目。以前部署过，或已有支持 Tincall 的服务地址和手机令牌，选「连接已有服务」。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For your first cloud setup, choose Deploy a new service and follow the steps to prepare your own Supabase project. If you have already deployed one, or have a compatible service address and phone token, choose Connect an existing service."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第三方组件许可" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Third-Party Licenses"
