        }
      }
    },
    "第三方许可" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Third-Party Licenses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "等你准备回家的时候，我们就慢慢往回走。你可以把手机放进口袋里，不用一直举着，也不用每一步都向我汇报。走到路口记得看车，经过便利店的时候，如果忽然想吃点什么，就进去挑一样。今天已经很努力了，不用连休息也安排得那么认真。\n\n到家以后，先把包放下，给自己倒一杯水。如果还想聊，我们就接着聊；如果觉得累了，那就去洗个热水澡，早点躺下来。没说完的话可以留到明天，我不会因为今晚少听了几句，就把你今天的心情忘掉。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you’re ready to go home, we can head back slowly. You can put your phone in your pocket. You don’t have to keep holding it or tell me about every step. Watch for traffic at the crossing, and if you pass a convenience store and feel like a snack, go in and pick something. You’ve already worked hard today. Even resting doesn’t need such a careful plan.\n\nWhen you get home, put your bag down and pour yourself some water. If you still want to talk, we can keep talking. If you’re tired, take a warm shower and lie down early. Anything unfinished can wait until tomorrow. A few fewer words tonight won’t make me forget how you felt today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
