    "聊天模型与摘要模型在「API设置」管理；声音 ID、合成模型和语音表达提示词在「文字转语音」管理；识别服务在「我的设置」中选择。添加后可被多个联系人复用，不必重复填写。\n\n联系人的名字、头像、通话方式和声音在联系人编辑页设置。独立模式还可选择聊天模型，在「对话设定」填写对方的设定、你的信息、双方关系和对话要求，并选择携带的历史摘要；后端与 MCP 的人物设定、上下文及回复由外部服务管理。\n\n独立模式每轮自动携带语音表达提示词。使用 Tincall 连接端的 MCP 接入时，通话开始时会提供一次朗读要求，AI 平台需保留并遵循。自有后端会在开始通话或接听请求中收到 expression_prompt，是否用于生成需由后端实现。" : {

    },
    "聊天模型与摘要模型在「API设置」管理；声音 ID、合成模型和语音表达提示词在「文字转语音」管理；识别服务在「我的设置」中选择。添加后可被多个联系人复用，不必重复填写。\n\n联系人的名字、头像、通话方式和声音在联系人编辑页设置。独立模式还可选择聊天模型，在「对话设定」填写对方的设定、你的信息、双方关系和对话要求，并选择携带的历史摘要；后端与 MCP 的人物设定、上下文及回复由外部服务管理。\n\n独立模式每轮自动携带语音表达提示词。使用 Tincall 连接端的 MCP 接入时，首次等待结果会返回 voice_instructions，AI 平台需保留并遵循。自有后端会在开始通话或接听请求中收到 expression_prompt，是否用于生成需由后端实现。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Manage chat and summary models in API Settings; voice IDs, synthesis models, and speech expression instructions in Text to Speech; and recognition services in My Settings. Saved presets can be reused by multiple contacts.\n\nSet a contact’s name, avatar, call mode, and voice in the contact editor. Standalone also lets you select a chat model, fill in Conversation Instructions with information about the other person, yourself, your relationship, and conversation preferences, and choose past summaries to include. Backend and MCP leave persona, context, and reply generation to the external service.\n\nStandalone includes speech expression instructions with every turn. With MCP through the Tincall connector, the first wait result provides voice_instructions, which the AI platform must retain and follow. A custom backend receives expression_prompt when a call starts or is answered; the backend must implement its use during generation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聊天模型与摘要模型在「API设置」管理；声音 ID、合成模型和语音表达提示词在「文字转语音」管理；识别服务在「我的设置」中选择。添加后可被多个联系人复用，不必重复填写。\n\n联系人的名字、头像、通话方式和声音在联系人编辑页设置。独立模式还可选择聊天模型、设置人物设定和历史摘要；后端与 MCP 的人物设定、上下文及回复由外部服务管理。\n\n独立模式每轮自动携带语音表达提示词。使用 Tincall 连接端的 MCP 接入时，首次等待结果会返回 voice_instructions，AI 平台需保留并遵循。自有后端会在开始通话或接听请求中收到 expression_prompt，是否用于生成需由后端实现。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Manage chat and summary models in API Settings; voice IDs, synthesis models, and speech expression instructions in Text to Speech; and recognition services in My Settings. Saved presets can be reused by multiple contacts.\n\nSet a contact’s name, avatar, call mode, and voice in the contact editor. Standalone also lets you select a chat model and configure a persona and past summaries. Backend and MCP leave persona, context, and reply generation to the external service.\n\nStandalone includes speech expression instructions with every turn. With MCP through the Tincall connector, the first wait result provides voice_instructions, which the AI platform must retain and follow. A custom backend receives expression_prompt when a call starts or is answered; the backend must implement its use during generation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聊天模型与摘要模型在「API设置」管理；声音 ID、合成模型和语音表达提示词在「文字转语音」管理；识别服务在「我的设置」中选择。添加后可被多个联系人复用，不必重复填写。\n联系人的名字、头像、通话方式、聊天模型、声音和人物设定，在联系人编辑页设置。独立模式会使用启用的人物设定、历史摘要和当前通话；后端与 MCP 的 AI 设定和上下文由外部服务管理。语音表达提示词在独立模式自动使用，外部平台需自行加入相应提示词。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Manage chat and summary models in API Settings. Manage voice IDs, speech models, and voice expression prompts in Text to Speech. Choose recognition in My Settings. Multiple contacts can reuse these presets.\nSet a contact’s name, photo, call mode, chat model, voice, and persona in the contact editor. Independent Mode uses the enabled persona, past summaries, and current call. External services manage AI settings and context in Backend and MCP modes. Voice expression prompts are included automatically in Independent Mode; add them separately to external platforms."
          }
        }
      }
    },
