    "请阅读以下通话记录，生成一份简洁、完整的摘要。\n\n要求：\n1. 按话题归纳主要内容，合并重复信息，不逐句复述。\n2. 保留关键细节、前后变化，以及对话中明确达成的约定。\n3. 准确区分双方的表述，不把提问、假设或未确认的信息写成事实。\n4. 忠实于原文，不添加推测，不补全未说完或被打断的内容。\n\n直接输出摘要正文，不要添加开场白或解释总结过程。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Read the following call transcript and produce a concise, complete summary.\n\nRequirements:\n1. Group the main points by topic, merge repeated information, and avoid restating each line.\n2. Preserve key details, developments, and any agreements explicitly reached in the conversation.\n3. Accurately distinguish what each speaker said. Do not present questions, assumptions, or unconfirmed information as facts.\n4. Stay faithful to the transcript. Do not add speculation or complete unfinished or interrupted remarks.\n\nOutput only the summary, without an introduction or an explanation of your summarization process."
          }
        }
      }
    },
