    },
    "退出通话" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Close call"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "适合希望从 Tincall 拨号或说话时自动唤醒 AI 的用户，也支持 AI 主动来电。需按仓库指南运行接入程序，自行配置外部 AI 的启动命令和此处的专用 MCP；也可在支持自动化的平台自行配置。程序自动取齐消息后启动 AI，回复工具立即返回，本轮结束，下一轮再唤醒。普通 MCP 则会在回复后继续等待下一句话。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For waking AI automatically when you call or speak in Tincall. AI-initiated calls are also supported. Follow the repository guide to run the adapter, supplying your external AI launch command and configuring the dedicated MCP shown here. You can also set up the workflow in a platform that supports automation. The adapter collects input before starting the AI; the reply tool returns immediately and the task ends until the next wake. Ordinary MCP instead keeps waiting for the next message after replying."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "适合直接在支持 MCP 的 AI 平台中使用。支持 AI 主动来电；AI 调用回复工具后，工具默认挂起等待你的下一句话，每次最多 2 分钟，超时可继续等待，不会自动挂断。从 Tincall 拨号不能自动唤醒 AI；需要自动唤醒可选「MCP＋唤醒桥」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For direct use with an AI platform that supports MCP. The AI can call you. After the AI invokes the reply tool, the tool stays pending while waiting for your next input, for up to 2 minutes by default. Waiting can continue after a timeout; the call does not hang up automatically. Calling from Tincall cannot automatically wake the AI. Choose MCP + Wake Bridge if you need automatic waking."
          }
        }
      }
    },
