          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通话服务：独立模式会把启用的上下文、当前输入及支持的图片发送到所选模型服务；第三方语音识别接收语音，语音合成服务接收待朗读文字。Apple 本机识别在设备上运行，首次使用可能需要下载系统语言模型。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Call services: Independent Mode sends enabled context, current input, and supported images to your selected model service. Third-party speech recognition receives audio, and speech synthesis receives the text to read aloud. Apple on-device recognition runs on your device and may need to download a system language model on first use."
