    },
    "通过电脑或服务器部署的服务，请前往 GitHub 上的 Tincall 代码仓库获取新版源码，并按原部署方式更新。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For services deployed from a computer or server, get the latest source from the Tincall code repository on GitHub and update using the original deployment method."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "那些聊过的话，留在这台 iPhone。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your conversations, saved on this iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "那我陪你坐一会儿。你不用急着找话题，也不用想着一定要说点有意思的事。看看水，吹吹风，听听路过的人在聊什么，等那阵急着赶路的感觉慢慢散掉。今天有没有哪一个很小的瞬间，让你觉得，啊，好像也没有那么糟？哪怕只是买到一杯刚好合口味的饮料，或者回家的时候，恰好看见了一片很好看的云。你想到什么，就慢慢告诉我，我就在这里听。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Then I’ll sit with you for a while. You don’t need to find a topic right away, or think of something interesting to say. Watch the water, feel the breeze, listen to people passing by, and let that feeling of always being in a hurry slowly fade. Was there one small moment today that made you think things weren’t so bad after all? Maybe a drink that tasted just right, or a beautiful cloud you happened to see on the way home. Tell me whatever comes to mind, whenever you’re ready. I’m here to listen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
