    "首次部署：点上方「打开 Supabase」并登录，选择组织，再点 New project。按页面提示填写项目名称、数据库密码和地区，创建后等待 Supabase 项目就绪。数据库密码不用填到 Tincall。\n\n更新服务：打开此前通过这台手机部署的原 Supabase 项目，不要新建。通过电脑或服务器部署的服务，请前往 GitHub 上的 Tincall 代码仓库获取新版源码，并按原部署方式更新。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "First deployment: tap “Open Supabase” above and sign in. Select an organization, then click New project. Follow the page to enter a project name, database password, and region, then wait until the Supabase project is ready. Do not enter the database password in Tincall.\n\nUpdating: open the original Supabase project previously deployed by this phone instead of creating a new one. For services deployed from a computer or server, get the latest source from the Tincall code repository on GitHub and update using the original deployment method."
          }
        }
      }
    },
