            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose “Deploy or Update a Service” to set up Supabase or update a project deployed by this phone. If you have a service URL and phone access token, choose “Connect an Existing Service”. Update services deployed from a computer or server using the original method."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首次部署时选择自己的组织和套餐，创建一个空项目并等待可用；更新已有服务时使用原项目，不要另建项目。数据库密码不用填到 Tincall。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For a first deployment, select your organization and plan, create an empty project, and wait until it is ready. For an update, use the original project. Do not enter the database password in Tincall."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "高 · high" : {
