    "默认 4096" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Default: 4096"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认关闭。允许后，自动同步也会上传本机已保留的录音，并下载本机缺少的录音；不会开启新的录音或覆盖不同版本。关闭后停止自动上传与下载，已有文件保留。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off by default. When allowed, automatic sync uploads audio saved on this device and downloads missing cloud audio. It does not start recording or overwrite different versions. Turning this off stops automatic uploads and downloads and keeps existing files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认关闭。只备份已经保留的声音，不会开启录音，当前不包含图片。关闭后停止新上传和下载，已上传文件仍留在云端。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off by default. Backs up only recordings already saved; does not enable recording or include images. Turning this off stops new uploads and downloads. Uploaded files remain in the cloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认关闭。开启后可分别选择两方声音；关闭只停止保存后续录音，已有录音和文字记录会保留。数据保存在本机。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off by default. Choose whose voice to save when enabled. Turning this off stops saving new recordings; existing audio and text remain on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认对话对象" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Default Contact"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认对象用于手动接入。MCP 联系人在保存时独立配置身份，不使用这里的默认对象。仅用于备份或定时来电可留空。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The default contact is for manual setup. MCP contacts get separate identities when saved and do not use this default. Leave blank for backups or scheduled calls only."
