  "云端仍有一通通话未结束。请先结束当前通话，再重新拨打。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "Another call is still open on the server. End it before calling again."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "云端尚未确认 MCP 等待时长。请先更新连接端服务，再保存联系人设置。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "The server has not confirmed the MCP wait duration. Update the connector service, then save the contact settings."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "仅显示已授权的联系人。保存关联后会添加 Tincall 专用通话号码，保留原有号码和邮箱；姓名与头像可选择同步。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "Only contacts you have allowed are shown. Saving a link adds a dedicated Tincall call number while keeping existing numbers and emails. Name and photo sync is optional."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "使用系统电话拨打" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "Call Using Phone"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "在 ChatGPT 或 Claude 添加 MCP 服务时选择 OAuth，将授权页显示的一次性授权码填在这里。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "Choose OAuth when adding the MCP service in ChatGPT or Claude, then enter the one-time code shown on the authorization page here."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "在联系人「通话偏好」中开启「时间感知」，默认关闭。独立模式沿用原有时间上下文；MCP 和后端按手机记录的消息时间和时区提供协议时间标记，补发消息仍保留原来的消息时间，不改成重试时刻。\n\n这只是给 AI 的时间信息，不代表 AI 一定能准确判断现实时间。请先确认手机日期、时间和时区正确；后端或外部平台可能另有自己的时间上下文。\n\n回复中的协议时间标记会在手机显示和朗读前清理，正常对话里的日期与时间不会因此删除。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "Enable time awareness in Contact Call Preferences. It is off by default. Standalone mode keeps its existing time context; MCP and backend modes receive the phone message time and time zone. Retried messages keep their original message time.\n\nThis gives the AI time information, but does not guarantee accurate real-world time reasoning. Check the phone date, time, and time zone.\n\nProtocol time markers in replies are removed before display and speech; ordinary dates and times remain."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "处理 MCP OAuth 授权" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "Process MCP OAuth authorization"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "已授权。回到原授权页面刷新，继续连接。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "Authorized. Return to the original authorization page and refresh it to finish connecting."
        }
