    }
  },
  "服务端找不到这个联系人。请在联系人设置中检查后端联系人或重新获取 MCP 配置。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "The server cannot find this contact. Check the backend contact or fetch the MCP configuration again in contact settings."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "联系人身份与服务端配置冲突。请检查联系人绑定，确认选择了对应的服务端联系人。" : {
    "localizations" : {
