        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "The contact identity conflicts with the server configuration. Check that this contact is linked to the correct server contact."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "请求与已提交内容冲突。已收到的内容会保留，请返回联系人重新拨打；若仍出现，请更新连接端服务。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "This request conflicts with content already submitted. Received content is kept. Return to the contact and call again; if this continues, update the connector service."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "这个 MCP 客户端可以查看这位联系人的通话文字、发送回复及发起或结束通话。它不能访问其他联系人或云端备份。仅确认你刚刚发起的授权。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "This MCP client can read this contact’s call text, send replies, and start or end calls. It cannot access other contacts or cloud backups. Approve only a request you just initiated."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "这通通话已结束或不再存在。请返回联系人重新拨打。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "This call has ended or no longer exists. Return to the contact and call again."
