  },
  "连接端授权已失效。请在连接设置中检查或更新令牌后重试。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "Connector authorization has expired. Check or update the token in connection settings, then retry."
