  },
  "连接端服务暂时不可用。请稍后重试；若持续出现，请检查服务运行状态。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "The connector service is temporarily unavailable. Try again later; if this continues, check its status."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "连接端未接受当前配置。请检查联系人、通话模式及服务版本后重试。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "The connector rejected this configuration. Check the contact, call mode, and service version, then retry."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "连接端请求过于频繁。请稍等片刻再试。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "Too many connector requests. Wait a moment and try again."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "通话状态已变化。请在通话页面恢复连接；若通话已结束，请重新拨打。" : {
    "localizations" : {
      "en" : {
        "stringUnit" : {
          "state" : "translated",
          "value" : "The call state has changed. Restore the connection from the call screen, or call again if the call has ended."
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "正在保存" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saving"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "时间感知说明" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "About Time Awareness"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@说明" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "About %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后会把消息的发送时间告诉 TA，使用手机的时间和时区。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Share each message’s send time with the AI, using your phone’s date, time, and time zone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ChatGPT 接入" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect ChatGPT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude 接入" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect Claude"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. 复制上面的完整 URL，地址已包含 /mcp，不要重复追加。传输方式选 HTTP。\n\n2. 在 ChatGPT 添加自定义 MCP，身份验证选择 OAuth，使用动态客户端注册。\n\n3. 授权页显示一次性授权码后，到 Tincall 的「设置 → Tincall 云端」打开对应连接的「MCP OAuth 授权」，输入授权码，选择这位联系人并同意。\n\n4. 回到刚才的授权网页完成连接，再返回 ChatGPT 加载工具。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Copy the complete URL above. It already includes /mcp; do not append it again. Choose HTTP.\n\n2. Add a custom MCP in ChatGPT. Choose OAuth with dynamic client registration.\n\n3. When the authorization page shows a one-time code, open Settings → Tincall Cloud → the matching connection → MCP OAuth Authorization in Tincall. Enter the code, select this contact, and approve.\n\n4. Return to that authorization page to finish connecting, then return to ChatGPT and load the tools."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. 复制上面的完整 URL，填入 Claude 的 Add custom connector。\n\n2. Authentication 选择 Sign in now，OAuth client 选择 Register automatically，Transport 使用 Streamable HTTP。\n\n3. 授权页显示一次性授权码后，到 Tincall 的「设置 → Tincall 云端」打开对应连接的「MCP OAuth 授权」，输入授权码，选择这位联系人并同意。\n\n4. 回到刚才的授权网页完成连接，再返回 Claude 加载工具。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Copy the complete URL above into Claude’s Add custom connector.\n\n2. Choose Sign in now for Authentication, Register automatically for OAuth client, and Streamable HTTP for Transport.\n\n3. When the authorization page shows a one-time code, open Settings → Tincall Cloud → the matching connection → MCP OAuth Authorization in Tincall. Enter the code, select this contact, and approve.\n\n4. Return to that authorization page to finish connecting, then return to Claude and load the tools."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其他支持请求头的平台可直接填写上面的 Authorization。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On other platforms that support custom headers, enter the Authorization value shown above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点右上角 ✓ 保存联系人后，可复制 URL 和 Authorization，填入 AI 平台的 MCP 服务设置。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save this contact with ✓ at the top right, then copy the URL and Authorization into your AI platform’s MCP settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MCP 等待时长" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MCP Wait Duration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MCP 等待时长说明" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "About MCP Wait Duration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 回复后，最多等待你下一句话的时间。可填写 1–130 秒，默认 120 秒；超出范围会自动调整。\n\n等待超时不会挂断通话。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How long to wait for your next message after the AI replies. Enter 1–130 seconds; the default is 120 seconds. Values outside this range are adjusted automatically.\n\nA wait timeout does not end the call."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "秒" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "seconds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "适合直接在支持 MCP 的 AI 平台中使用。支持 AI 主动来电；AI 调用回复工具后，工具会挂起等待你的下一句话，默认120秒，可根据对应平台客户端超时时间自行调整，超时后不会自动挂断。从 Tincall 拨号不能自动唤醒 AI；需要自动唤醒可选「MCP＋唤醒桥」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For AI platforms that support MCP. The AI can call you. After replying, its tool waits for your next message for 120 seconds by default; adjust this to your platform’s client timeout. A timeout does not end the call. Calling from Tincall does not wake the AI automatically. Choose MCP + Wake Bridge if you need automatic wake-up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这套 Tincall 云端服务不支持当前 MCP 配置字段，通常是服务版本过旧。请在「设置 → Tincall 云端」检查服务版本并重新部署后，再保存联系人。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
