    "未能检查服务版本，请检查连接、访问令牌和服务状态后刷新。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn’t check the service version. Check the connection, access token, and service status, then refresh."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "独立模式：Tincall 直接连接模型 API，设定与对话由手机管理。日常通话和本地记录无需部署云端。\n\n普通 MCP：外部平台管理 AI，AI 可发起来电并处理 Tincall 发起的通话；从 Tincall 拨出不会自动唤醒外部 AI。AI 回复后默认每次等你的下一句话 120 秒；普通 MCP 可在联系人 MCP 设置中填写 1–130 秒。没有新消息会提示继续等待，不会挂断通话。\n\nMCP＋唤醒桥：仍使用 MCP 通话，但由接通和每轮新输入的事件触发 AI，AI 回复后结束本轮，下次消息再启动，不必持续等待。新版一键部署包含通用桥；在联系人编辑页选择该模式并复制配置。平台须支持 SSE 订阅和任务启动，或运行相应适配程序。普通 MCP 设置不能代替这部分接入。\n\n后端直连：已有聊天后端直接实现 Tincall 通话接口，由它管理设定、上下文和每轮生成，无需 MCP。也可通过一键部署的服务转发到真正的生成与取消接口。\n\n四种方式的识别与朗读均由 Tincall 处理。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Independent Mode: Tincall connects directly to a model API. Your phone manages the settings and conversation. Everyday calls and local records do not require a cloud deployment.\n\nOrdinary MCP: An external platform manages the AI. The AI can call you and handle calls started in Tincall, but calling from Tincall does not wake it automatically. After replying, the AI waits up to 120 seconds for your next message by default. For ordinary MCP, enter 1–130 seconds in the contact’s MCP settings. If no message arrives, it can continue waiting; the call is not ended.\n\nMCP + Wake Bridge: Calls still use MCP, but connection and new-input events trigger the AI. After replying, the AI finishes its current task and is started again for the next message, without continuously waiting. The latest one-click deployment includes a general-purpose bridge. Select this mode in the contact editor and copy its configuration. Your platform must support SSE subscriptions and task startup, or run an appropriate adapter. Ordinary MCP settings cannot replace this integration.\n\nDirect Backend: An existing chat backend implements the Tincall call interface and manages settings, context, and generation for each turn, without MCP. The one-click service can also forward to your actual generation and cancellation endpoints.\n\nTincall handles speech recognition and playback in all four modes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "普通 MCP 很快超时，或反复调用工具怎么办？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Why does ordinary MCP time out quickly or repeatedly call tools?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kelivo 的 MCP 请求超时默认 30 秒。请在 Kelivo 的 MCP 设置中调至 180 秒，再重新连接 Tincall。通话过程中，Kelivo 需要保持在前台。\n\nMuse 默认等待工具结果 45 秒，需要让 TA 调整调用工具时的等待时间；单次调用达到 120 秒会被转入后台，影响 TA 继续等待。建议将 Tincall 对应联系人的 MCP 等待时长设为 90 秒，并让 Muse 中的 TA 将工具等待时间设为 110 秒。这样 Tincall 会先结束本次等待；即使没有正常返回，Muse 也能在 110 秒时报告超时，让 TA 继续处理，避免拖到 120 秒被转入后台。\n\nTincall 的回复工具发送完整文字后，会继续等你下一句话；朗读和等待都占用这次请求的时间。Request timed out: tools/call 表示 AI 所在的平台没有及时收到工具结果，不代表回复没有发送，也不代表电话已经挂断。\n\n等待超时不会挂断通话，可以让 TA 继续等待。如果这一轮工具调用已经结束，可以主动发消息唤醒 TA，继续通话。播放停止不会提前结束等待。\n\n更新云端后，在 AI 平台刷新 Tincall 工具列表或断开后重连。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kelivo’s default MCP request timeout is 30 seconds. Change it to 180 seconds in Kelivo’s MCP settings, then reconnect Tincall. Keep Kelivo in the foreground during the call.\n\nMuse waits 45 seconds for tool results by default. Ask the AI to adjust its tool wait time. A call reaching 120 seconds is moved to the background, affecting continued waiting. Set this contact’s MCP wait duration in Tincall to 90 seconds and the AI’s tool wait time in Muse to 110 seconds. Tincall can then finish its wait first; if no result arrives, Muse can report a timeout at 110 seconds so the AI can continue before the 120-second background threshold.\n\nAfter sending the full reply, Tincall’s reply tool waits for your next message. Speech playback and waiting both count toward this request. “Request timed out: tools/call” means the AI platform did not receive the tool result in time; it does not mean the reply was not sent or the call ended.\n\nA wait timeout does not hang up. Ask the AI to keep waiting. If its current tool call has ended, send it a message to wake it and continue. Playback stopping does not end the wait early.\n\nAfter updating the cloud service, refresh the Tincall tools on your AI platform or disconnect and reconnect."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
